# MAGE fireball: a small ball of fire lobbed by a mage (a walker of a Mage tower; StructureSystem::tickCarriers aims it,
# NpcSystem::fireMageFireball sets its team and launch velocity). On ANY contact it damages EVERY enemy-team unit within
# SplashRadius of the impact (GameProjectileComponent::onContact), then despawns. SplashEdge: the full UnitDamage at the
# centre, falling linearly to 40 % of it at the edge. HitsShadows: a SHADOW (a demon that is not solid) takes its damage
# too. FireImpact: the impact bursts in embers (Effects/fire_blast.pfx + fire_flash.pfx, made by GameMatch) with a short
# orange light, on every role. The ball glows far over the bloom threshold, and carries a small orange point light.
# Replicated (Component Network).
Prefab gameMageFireball
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer gemsGlow
		Node Diamond
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 1 0.45 0.1
		Emissive 10
		Scale 0.16
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Layer Projectile
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 0.2
		Density 120
		Restitution 0.1
		ContactEvents true
	Component Light
		Light Point
			Color 1 0.5 0.15
			Intensity 20
			Range 5
	Component Network
	Component GameProjectile
		UnitDamage 15
		StructureDamage 0
		Lifetime 6
		SplashRadius 2
		SplashEdge 0.4
		HitsShadows true
		FireImpact true
